### Page content (summary)

- **Purpose:** AI judgment that diagram topology (arrows, gates, loops) matches captions, prose, and catalog `legend_map`—beyond `DET.DIAGRAM.*` mechanical checks.
- **Passing / failing signals:** Template family fit (`template-gate-chain` vs `template-loop-cycle`), arrow direction vs agency, label/legend alignment, modal legend consistency.
- **Before (fail):** `template-loop-cycle.svg` + cyclic `alt` under copy/figcaption claiming a linear human→agent gate chain (`forge-section`, `ks-diagram-tile`, `figcaption`).
- **After (pass):** `template-gate-chain.svg` with `forge-diagram-trigger`, `data-diagram-key`, and support copy that matches left-to-right gate topology.
- **Evidence & remediation:** PDCA steps ending with optional `DET.DIAGRAM.*` candidate when mismatches repeat.
- **Related rules:** `DET.DIAGRAM.LABELS`, `DET.DIAGRAM.ALT`, `DET.DIAGRAM.ASSET_REGISTRY`, `DET.HASH.MARKERS`, `AI.VISUAL.PRODUCT_EXPLANATORY_VALUE`, `AI.DATA.INSIGHT_LEGIBILITY`.

No Mermaid, no Fleet-specific profiles.

